[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3299319284","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110566#issuecomment-3299319284","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110566","id":3299319284,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Ep530","user":{"login":"Alex2782","id":41921395,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxOTIxMzk1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41921395?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782","html_url":"https://github.com/Alex2782","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-16T15:34:48Z","updated_at":"2025-09-16T15:50:24Z","body":"> oxipng -o max --zopfli -a -s\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/oxipng/oxipng/issues/414#issuecomment-1295797975\r\n\r\n~~Note: `Zopfli` is supposedly very slow, but I haven't done any tests yet (on Android). I think performance and loading times on Android are more important than saving a few bytes of memory.~~ \r\n\r\n**EDIT:** on Android it should have little / no effect, the GH issue is only about Zopfli option\r\n\r\n-----------\r\n\r\nI'm wondering if we still need PNG files on Android.\r\n\r\nIf we have SVG files we can solve (almost) everything with `Shape drawable`, import via Android Studio.\r\nhttps://developer.android.com/guide/topics/resources/drawable-resource#Shape\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3299319284/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3299382354","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110566#issuecomment-3299382354","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110566","id":3299382354,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7EqJRS","user":{"login":"lumiscosity","id":26834471,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2ODM0NDcx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26834471?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lumiscosity","html_url":"https://github.com/lumiscosity","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lumiscosity/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lumiscosity/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lumiscosity/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lumiscosity/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lumiscosity/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lumiscosity/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lumiscosity/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lumiscosity/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lumiscosity/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-16T15:51:05Z","updated_at":"2025-09-16T15:52:52Z","body":"Zopfli is slow *to compress with*. This has no effect on reading the resulting files. This PR serves to optimize the existing files in the repo, not to introduce a compression step on asset import, game export or similar.\r\n\r\nSwitching to SVG to save space on Android sounds like a good idea, but is out of scope for this commit.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3299382354/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3300190710","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110566#issuecomment-3300190710","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110566","id":3300190710,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7EtOn2","user":{"login":"Oondanomala","id":87101222,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3MTAxMjIy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/87101222?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oondanomala","html_url":"https://github.com/Oondanomala","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oondanomala/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oondanomala/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oondanomala/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oondanomala/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oondanomala/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oondanomala/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oondanomala/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oondanomala/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oondanomala/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-16T20:08:24Z","updated_at":"2025-09-16T20:08:45Z","body":"Even more can be saved (though usually it's not much, in the order of bytes) by combining multiple PNG optimizers like [ECT](https://github.com/fhanau/Efficient-Compression-Tool), [pngwolf](https://github.com/jibsen/pngwolf-zopfli) [Deflopt](https://encode.su/threads/3257-Deflopt), [defluff](https://encode.su/threads/1214-defluff-a-deflate-huffman-optimizer), [deft4j](https://github.com/NeRdTheNed/deft4j), and probably even more that I forgot (yeah, it's a lot). ECT should provide the biggest gains.\r\nI was able to optimize main/splash.png from 14705 bytes to 14568, for example.\r\nAll of this should be lossless and safe to do, though I haven't actually checked that.\r\nNot sure how worth it this is (considering it can take a while to optimize, and how small the savings are), but it should be even more free savings, so I thought it was worth to mention.","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3300190710/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3300222087","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110566#issuecomment-3300222087","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110566","id":3300222087,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7EtWSH","user":{"login":"lumiscosity","id":26834471,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2ODM0NDcx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26834471?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lumiscosity","html_url":"https://github.com/lumiscosity","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lumiscosity/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lumiscosity/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lumiscosity/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lumiscosity/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lumiscosity/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lumiscosity/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lumiscosity/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lumiscosity/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lumiscosity/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-16T20:18:39Z","updated_at":"2025-09-16T20:21:21Z","body":"I'll admit this is my first time hearing about some of those extra tools. It's possible some of the remaining byte savings from those are from stripping some chunks that this oxipng config avoids, such as the colorspace information, removing which is often undesirable and can lead to visible changes in the image. I'll have to manually verify these on my own time.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3300222087/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3300272102","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110566#issuecomment-3300272102","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110566","id":3300272102,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Etifm","user":{"login":"Oondanomala","id":87101222,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3MTAxMjIy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/87101222?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oondanomala","html_url":"https://github.com/Oondanomala","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oondanomala/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oondanomala/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oondanomala/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oondanomala/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oondanomala/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oondanomala/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oondanomala/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oondanomala/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oondanomala/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-16T20:35:33Z","updated_at":"2025-09-16T20:39:10Z","body":"The original main/splash.png does not have any additional chunks, so that is definitely not what happened on that image.\r\nAlso, as far as i know (if configured correctly) none of the programs should remove extra chunks, as they are all generic deflate optimizers. (and some of the byte savings are straight up smaller than a chunk can be, which is 12 bytes IIRC)\r\nThe output is also pixel by pixel identical according to ImageMagick.\r\nStill, each should probably be checked manually using [pngcheck](https://github.com/pnggroup/pngcheck) for extra chunks and something like ImageMagick to make sure the actual image is the same.","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3300272102/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3300331222","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110566#issuecomment-3300331222","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110566","id":3300331222,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Etw7W","user":{"login":"lumiscosity","id":26834471,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2ODM0NDcx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26834471?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lumiscosity","html_url":"https://github.com/lumiscosity","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lumiscosity/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lumiscosity/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lumiscosity/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lumiscosity/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lumiscosity/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lumiscosity/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lumiscosity/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lumiscosity/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lumiscosity/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-16T20:58:10Z","updated_at":"2025-09-16T21:02:00Z","body":"Gave all of these a whirl on a test file with sensitive data chunks. ECT segfaults without the safe option, all others work great and have indeed shaved off some bytes while preserving the important stuff. Always glad to learn of more possible optimizations!\r\n\r\nSince it's late right now I'll apply these to this PR tommorow.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3300331222/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3300396143","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110566#issuecomment-3300396143","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110566","id":3300396143,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7EuAxv","user":{"login":"Alex2782","id":41921395,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxOTIxMzk1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41921395?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782","html_url":"https://github.com/Alex2782","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-16T21:22:22Z","updated_at":"2025-09-16T21:25:17Z","body":"> Since it's late right now I'll apply these to this PR tommorow.\r\n\r\nMaybe it's better to convert directly to webp? _(everything that is in the Android mipmap folder)_\r\nhttps://developer.android.com/develop/ui/views/graphics/reduce-image-sizes#webp\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<img width=\"624\" height=\"353\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2066b1b0-b2ee-4e32-827a-13a1573554e4\" />\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3300396143/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3301012426","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110566#issuecomment-3301012426","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110566","id":3301012426,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7EwXPK","user":{"login":"Oondanomala","id":87101222,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3MTAxMjIy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/87101222?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oondanomala","html_url":"https://github.com/Oondanomala","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oondanomala/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oondanomala/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oondanomala/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oondanomala/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oondanomala/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oondanomala/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oondanomala/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oondanomala/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oondanomala/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-17T02:39:48Z","updated_at":"2025-09-17T02:39:48Z","body":"I'm far from an expert in webp, but simply trying to convert the already optimized main/splash.png into a lossless webp goes from 14568 to 9064.\r\nSo pretty good savings, assuming I did everything right.\r\nConverting `platform/android/java/lib/res/mipmap/icon.png` into webp goes from 10571 to 8022 bytes, to reference an image that would actually use webp (thought I did not fully optimize this png).","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3301012426/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3302094492","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110566#issuecomment-3302094492","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110566","id":3302094492,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7E0fac","user":{"login":"lumiscosity","id":26834471,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2ODM0NDcx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26834471?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lumiscosity","html_url":"https://github.com/lumiscosity","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lumiscosity/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lumiscosity/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lumiscosity/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lumiscosity/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lumiscosity/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.githu